  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MF3-03 Enhancing Climate Resilience of Coastal Communities in Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation International Aotearoa will work with communities in Timor-Leste to develop marine protected areas, strengthen marine management plans, improve&#xa0;the livelihoods and resilience of fishers and their communities,&#xa0;and support&#xa0;shared fisheries management between Timor-Leste and Indonesia.</narrative>
  </description>
